flowchart TD
  Forms[Six forms: LLM / MCP / A2A × internal / external] --> Cloud[Choose AWS / Azure / GCP]
  Cloud --> Intake[Strict parser + schema + policy + secret scan]
  Intake --> PR[Draft PR: catalog + four scoped upstream mappings]
  PR --> CI[Read-only CI: tests + security checks + review]
  CI --> Main[Protected main]
  Main --> Build[Build release: immutable bundle / 24 targets / US]
  Build -. same original release run ID .-> Dev[Independent trigger: Deploy dev]
  Build -. same original release run ID .-> Test[Independent trigger: Deploy test]
  Build -. same original release run ID .-> Preprod[Independent trigger: Deploy preprod]
  Build -. same original release run ID .-> Prod[Independent trigger: Deploy prod]
  Dev -. successful dev evidence required .-> Test
  Test -. successful test evidence required .-> Preprod
  Preprod -. successful preprod evidence required .-> Prod
  Note[Every dispatch: security and provenance checks → plan → target approval → apply → readiness and smoke → verified receipt]
  Manual[No automatic stage chaining. Each run selects exactly one cloud / exposure / stage.]
